    "风过残铃": "Wind Through Broken Bells",
    "高处的铃声，需要一次次稳稳落脚。": "Every broken bell asks for another steady landing.",
    "借风升上高廊 · 两次转面避火 · 窄台升阶后带钥匙折返": "Rise to the high gallery · turn twice through fire · climb narrow steps with the key",
