    "风柱托起后再往右，先稳住高廊": "Let the wind lift you, then move right onto the gallery",
    "转面火廊 · 提前两步起跳": "Turned fire gallery · jump two steps before the flame",
    "向左逐级落脚 · 松开跳跃再起飞": "Land on each step to the left · release Jump before taking off again"
  }
